function drawParticles(){for(const p of game.particles){let q=spritePos(p),sz=clamp((H*.035)/q.d,1,16);if(Math.abs(q.ang)>Math.PI/3)continue;ctx.globalAlpha=clamp(p.life,0,1);ctx.fillStyle=p.color;ctx.shadowColor=p.color;ctx.shadowBlur=10;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(q.x,H*.5+H*.5/q.d,sz,0,TAU);ctx.fill()}ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.shadowBlur=0}
function addBurst(x,y,color,n=10){for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let a=rand(0,TAU),v=rand(.3,2);game.particles.push({x,y,vx:Math.cos(a)*v,vy:Math.sin(a)*v,color,life:rand(.35,.8)})}}
function nearestTarget(maxAngle=.12,maxDist=12){let best=null,score=Infinity;for(const e of game.enemies){let dx=e.x-game.player.x,dy=e.y-game.player.y,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy),a=Math.atan2(dy,dx)-game.player.a;while(a>Math.PI)a-=TAU;while(a< -Math.PI)a+=TAU;if(d>maxDist||Math.abs(a)>maxAngle)continue;let wall=castRay(Math.atan2(dy,dx)).d;if(wall<d-.25)continue;let s=Math.abs(a)*4+d*.003;if(s<score){score=s;best=e}}return best}
function hurtEnemy(e,damage){if(!game.enemies.includes(e))return;e.hp-=damage;e.hit=.12;addBurst(e.x,e.y,e.boss?'#ff5362':'#ffd087',4);if(e.hp<=0){game.enemies.splice(game.enemies.indexOf(e),1);const p=game.player;p.kills++;p.xp+=e.boss?150:28;addBurst(e.x,e.y,'#ffb764',18);game.drops.push({x:e.x,y:e.y,bob:rand(0,TAU)});toast(e.boss?'✦ RIFT GUARDIAN SLAIN ✦':'+28 EXPERIENCE');levelCheck();if(e.boss){game.rift.guardianDown=true;toast('THE GUARDIAN FALLS — SEAL THE RIFT')}}}
function levelCheck(){let p=game.player;while(p.xp>=p.next){p.xp-=p.next;p.level++;p.next=Math.floor(p.next*1.38);p.maxHp+=18;p.maxMp+=12;p.hp=p.maxHp;p.mp=p.maxMp;p.damage+=4;toast(`LEVEL ${p.level} • VITALITY RESTORED`)}}
function shoot(){if(game.shootCd>0||!game.running||invOpen)return;game.shootCd=.28;game.mp=Math.min(game.maxMp,game.mp+3);const target=nearestTarget(.16,12);if(target){hurtEnemy(target,game.player.damage+game.player.weaponBonus||game.player.damage);}
 let end=target?{x:target.x,y:target.y}:(()=>{let r=castRay(game.player.a,8);return{x:game.player.x+Math.cos(game.player.a)*r.d,y:game.player.y+Math.sin(game.player.a)*r.d}})();game.shots.push({x1:game.player.x,y1:game.player.y,x2:end.x,y2:end.y,life:.09});addBurst(end.x,end.y,'#85fff0',2)}
function nova(){let p=game.player;if(game.novaCd>0||p.mp<28)return;p.mp-=28;game.novaCd=4.2;addBurst(p.x,p.y,'#52e7e0',28);for(const e of [...game.enemies])if(dist(p,e)<4)hurtEnemy(e,58+p.level*5);toast('✧ VOID NOVA ✧')}
